    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Master, I want to take you outside.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Miya, the pet cat, tells me to go outside and look up at the sky,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I see a starry sky and... countless &quot;dried sardines&quot; falling from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the dried sardines to make Miya happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Cloudy Days, Dried Dried Sardines&quot; is a casual catch game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is click the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the dried sardines falling from the sky by clicking them to aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use the coins you collect in the game to spin the &quot;Dress Up Gacha.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cute outfits for Miya, who loves fashion.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Master, I want to take you outside.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Miya, the pet cat, tells me to go outside and look up at the sky,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I see a starry sky and... countless &quot;dried sardines&quot; falling from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the dried sardines to make Miya happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Cloudy Days, Dried Dried Sardines&quot; is a casual catch game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is click the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the dried sardines falling from the sky by clicking them to aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use the coins you collect in the game to spin the &quot;Dress Up Gacha.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cute outfits for Miya, who loves fashion.</p>",
